        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-2617, Beaded Bow Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 8 finishes, this beaded cabinet pull has a classic design that will add old world charm to any space. RK International's Beaded Edge Cabinet Pull has a 3 inch center to center making it the perfect size for almost any small door or drawer.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/plain-knob-with-beaded-edge-rk-international-ck-9310\"><b>Beaded Cabinet Knob</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/beaded-oblong-cabinet-pull-backplate-rk-international-bp-1792\"><b>Beaded Edge Cabinet Pull Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-2617 Traditional Beaded Cabinet Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BP-1792-finish_copy.jpg?v=1718231173\" width=\"593\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
